## 복습 테스트

### 1.
The store was crowded, _____ we decided to leave.

(A) therefore
(B) so
(C) however

### 2.
The product is expensive. _____, many people buy it.

(A) However
(B) So
(C) And

### 3.
She can _____ call us or send an email.

(A) both
(B) either
(C) neither

### 4.
'대안'을 영어로 쓰시오.

### 5.
'혹시 보신 적 있나요?'를 영어로 말해 보세요.

## 정답

